---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '从机场到中国城市：最有效的方式';
const description = 'Metro, Didi, taxi, or airport bus — how to choose and what to expect at major Chinese airports.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/transport/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Transport
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛬 运输</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        From Airport to City in China: What Usually Works Best
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">地铁、滴滴、出租车或机场大巴——如何选择以及中国主要机场的预期情况。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>坐地铁</strong> if your flight arrives during the day and you have light luggage — it's cheap (¥5–10) and avoids traffic. <strong>使用DiDi</strong> if you're tired, have heavy bags, or arrive late at night (¥80–200). Avoid unlicensed taxis; stick to the official taxi queue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#metro" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 选项1：地铁（最适合大多数旅行者）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#didi" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚗 选项2：滴滴（最适合门到门）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#taxi" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚕 选项3：出租车</a></li>
        <li><a href="#bus" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚌 选项4：机场巴士</a></li>
        <li><a href="#reference" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📊 机场快速参考</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <h2 id="metro" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🚇 选项1：地铁（最适合大多数旅行者）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中国主要城市的主要机场都有直达市中心的地铁线路。票价仅为5至10日元，该服务避免了道路交通堵塞，所有车站标志都包括英文翻译。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>如果：</strong> You have light luggage, arrive during operating hours (typically 6:00–23:00), and your hotel is near a metro station.</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>跳过以下情况：</strong> You have heavy luggage, arrive late at night, or you’re tired and just want to get to your hotel door-to-door.</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选项2：滴滴（最适合门到门）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">If you have DiDi set up (see the <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">滴滴指南</a>)，你可以从机场接机区预订一程。该应用程序提前显示预估票价，支持支付宝/微信支付，您可以实时跟踪您的司机。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>典型成本：</strong> ¥80–200 depending on distance and city.</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选项3：出租车</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">到达大厅外的官方出租车招呼站有出租车。将您的酒店名称和地址翻译成中文，并展示给司机。确保他们使用仪表。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>成本：</strong> A little more expensive than DiDi, and potentially higher if traffic is bad.</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选项4：机场巴士</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">大多数主要机场都有通往城市关键地区的巴士路线。它们比出租车便宜（20-40日元），但速度较慢，也不太方便。并非所有人都有英语标志。</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">机场快速参考</h2>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">机场</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">地铁到市中心</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">DiDi到中心</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">北京首都（PEK）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥30，60分钟</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥120，45分钟</td></tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">北京大兴（PKX）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">35元，50分钟</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">180元，60分钟</td></tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">上海浦东（PVG）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥8，50分钟</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">180元，50分钟</td></tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">广州白云（加拿大）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥8，40分钟</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥100，40分钟</td></tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">深圳宝安（SZX）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥8，40分钟</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">¥80，35分钟</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>我的建议：</strong> Take the metro if your flight arrives during the day and you don’t have too much luggage. Use DiDi if you’re tired, have lots of bags, or arrive late. Don’t take an unlicensed taxi — stick to the official taxi queue.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="related" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 not-prose">
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何环游中国</strong> — the complete transport guide</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何预订和乘坐中国高铁</strong> — booking and riding tips</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚗 <strong>外国人如何在中国使用滴滴</strong> — set up ride-hailing</a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">💳 <strong>外国人如何设置支付宝</strong> — pay for your ride</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常变化。没有单一官方来源。出行前请查询当前推荐。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.bcia.com.cn/wljc.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">北京首都机场-交通指南</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.shanghaiairport.com/ensh/gdjt/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">上海机场-交通</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gbiac.net/traffic/tfa?urlKey=to-from-airport_en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">广州白云机场-机场交通</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>